                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-[#111827]">Team Members & Staff Accounts</h3>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-[#6B7280] mt-0.5">Grant employee access with role-based permissions (1 Pro, 5 Business).</p>
